# Optional local-dev secrets for `pnpm showcase:dev` (wrangler picks up `.dev.vars`).
#   cp showcase/.dev.vars.example showcase/.dev.vars
#
# The demo bearer tokens are baked as a wrangler VAR (APPROVAL_ACTOR_TOKENS in
# wrangler.jsonc) — the UI's ActorSwitcher uses them, so you need NO secret to
# click through the showcase locally. Do NOT set APPROVAL_ACTOR_TOKENS here: a
# .dev.vars entry overrides the var and would break the demo tokens.
#
# For a real deployment, replace the demo tokens with a secret instead
# (`wrangler secret put APPROVAL_ACTOR_TOKENS`) and put real secrets here for
# local dev, e.g. the optional SIEM audit-export auth header:
# SIEM_AUTH_HEADER=Bearer your-siem-token
